<li><span class="preview-intro-panel__info-circle"></span> 批量抠图，完成后可批量编辑 </li><li><span class="preview-intro-panel__info-circle"></span> 批量添加背景 </li><li><span class="preview-intro-panel__info-circle"></span> 批量添加投影/滤镜 </li><li><span class="preview-intro-panel__info-circle"></span> 批量调整尺寸 </li></ul><button type="button" class="gda-btn gda-btn-primary"><span>开始批量抠图</span></button></div></div></div></div><div class="landing__wrap"><div class="id-card-intro"><div class="landing-module-header"><h2>证件照</h2><p>多尺寸多底色证件照，并提供人像美化功能</p><button type="button" class="gda-btn gda-btn-primary"><span>生成证件照</span></button></div><ul class="id-card-intro__list"><li class="id-card-intro__item"><div class="id-card-intro__item-header"><span class="id-card-intro__item-num">1.</span><span class="id-card-intro__item-title">原图</span></div><picture class="lazy-image-modern lazy-image-modern--lazy" data-v-4241db4e><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://cdn.dancf.com/fe-assets/20240510/5adeb3b407428dfd13d5b5c18af43c98.png?x-oss-process=image/format,webp"><source srcset="https://cdn.dancf.com/fe-assets/20240510/5adeb3b407428dfd13d5b5c18af43c98.png"><img src="https://cdn.dancf.com/fe-assets/20240510/5adeb3b407428dfd13d5b5c18af43c98.png?x-oss-process=image" alt="证件照抠图演示图 流程原图" loading="lazy" alt="证件照抠图演示图 流程原图" class="resp-img__img lazy-image-modern__img"></picture></li><li class="id-card-intro__item"><div class="id-card-intro__item-header"><span class="id-card-intro__item-num">2.</span><span class="id-card-intro__item-title">删除背景</span></div><picture class="lazy-image-modern lazy-image-modern--lazy" data-v-4241db4e><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://cdn.dancf.com/fe-assets/20240510/280400c696d9a4f36cefdbe9c5494a39.png?x-oss-process=image/format,webp"><source srcset="https://cdn.dancf.com/fe-assets/20240510/280400c696d9a4f36cefdbe9c5494a39.png"><img src="https://cdn.dancf.com/fe-assets/20240510/280400c696d9a4f36cefdbe9c5494a39.png?x-oss-process=image" alt="证件照抠图演示图 流程删除背景" loading="lazy" alt="证件照抠图演示图 流程删除背景" class="resp-img__img lazy-image-modern__img"></picture></li><li class="id-card-intro__item"><div class="id-card-intro__item-header"><span class="id-card-intro__item-num">3.</span><span class="id-card-intro__item-title">调整背景尺寸</span></div><picture class="lazy-image-modern lazy-image-modern--lazy" data-v-4241db4e><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://cdn.dancf.com/fe-assets/20240510/de600191d83bb5104a32cee53bbe0756.png?x-oss-process=image/format,webp"><source srcset="https://cdn.dancf.com/fe-assets/20240510/de600191d83bb5104a32cee53bbe0756.png"><img src="https://cdn.dancf.com/fe-assets/20240510/de600191d83bb5104a32cee53bbe0756.png?x-oss-process=image" alt="证件照抠图演示图 流程调整背景尺寸" loading="lazy" alt="证件照抠图演示图 流程调整背景尺寸" class="resp-img__img lazy-image-modern__img"></picture></li><li class="id-card-intro__item"><div class="id-card-intro__item-header"><span class="id-card-intro__item-num">4.</span><span class="id-card-intro__item-title">导出应用</span></div><picture class="lazy-image-modern lazy-image-modern--lazy" data-v-4241db4e><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://cdn.dancf.com/fe-assets/20240510/aa351c8b5d2b4a523fdd2d0c819637f0.png?x-oss-process=image/format,webp"><source srcset="https://cdn.dancf.com/fe-assets/20240510/aa351c8b5d2b4a523fdd2d0c819637f0.png"><img src="https://cdn.dancf.com/fe-assets/20240510/aa351c8b5d2b4a523fdd2d0c819637f0.png?x-oss-process=image" alt="证件照抠图演示图 流程导出应用" loading="lazy" alt="证件照抠图演示图 流程导出应用" class="resp-img__img lazy-image-modern__img"></picture></li></ul></div></div><div class="landing_wrap"><div class="description-info-card"><div class="swiper-list-with-grid__container swiper-list-with-grid__container--start-reached swiper-list-with-grid__container--end-reached swiper-list-with-grid__container--no-fade swiper-list-with-grid__container--hide-tools-when-not-hover" style="--extend-x:0px;--extend-top:0px;--extend-bottom:0px;"><div class="swiper-list-with-grid__content"><div class="grid-container grid-container--no-wrap swiper-list-with-grid__grid-container" style="--grid-gap-size:24px;--grid-column-min-width:300px;"><div class="grid-container__ruler"><div class="_observer_igwtw_1 swiper-list-with-grid__observer swiper-list-with-grid__observer--start"></div><div class="description-info-card__card"><h2 class="description-info-card__card--title"> 丰富多样的抠图模板 </h2><span class="description-info-card__card--content"> 基于先进的AI技术，能够在完成抠图后自动应用丰富的抠图模板快速生成高质量图片。无论是电商商品图、证件照还是社交媒体配图，均可通过一键操作实现批量处理和多场景应用。用户只需上传图片，即可享受智能抠除背景、自动填充、批量编辑等功能，轻松生成符合需求的专业级图片，大幅提升工作效率和创作体验。 </span></div><div class="description-info-card__card"><h2 class="description-info-card__card--title"> 基于电商细分品类深度学习 </h2><span class="description-info-card__card--content"> 基于电商细分品类深度学习，对于美妆产品，可以覆盖手持、多品、关联等多场景，准确识别关联主体，清晰抠除手持物品，并精准识别多品场景。鞋靴类产品则保证细节的精准抠除，确保地面衔接无残留且细节部分不丢失。箱包类产品能够精准识别主体及其阴影，完美抠除缝隙和孔洞。而对于个护产品，则通过图片超分技术使对比原图加倍清晰，精准识别主体及相似颜色，并去除不相关元素。无论是哪种电商产品，都能通过稿定设计实现高效、专业的图片处理。 </span></div><div class="description-info-card__card"><h2 class="description-info-card__card--title"> AI 加持抠图场景 </h2><span class="description-info-card__card--content"> 通过先进的AI技术实现了智能化图片处理。基于抠图后的商品图像，系统能够自动生成高质量的商品主图，使得电商展示更加专业和吸引人。同时，AI变清晰功能对比原图可使图片加倍清晰，显著增强画质并突出细节，让每一个产品展示都更加精致和逼真。这些智能化功能大幅提升了图片处理效率，为用户提供了便捷且高效的创作体验。 </span></div><div class="description-info-card__card"><h2 class="description-info-card__card--title"> 全场景覆盖 </h2><span class="description-info-card__card--content"> 抠图能力能够智能处理商品、人像和文字等多种类型的图片。无论是电商产品展示、人像照片还是带有文字的图像，AI技术都能精准识别并高效抠除背景，确保主体清晰突出。通过这种全方位的智能抠图能力，用户可以轻松应对各种设计需求，大幅提升创作效率和作品质量。 </span></div><div class="description-info-card__card"><h2 class="description-info-card__card--title"> 证件照 </h2><span class="description-info-card__card--content"> 证件照功能为用户提供了多尺寸、多底色的证件照制作选项，并附带人像美化功能。用户只需上传原图，系统便会自动删除背景，智能调整背景尺寸，并快速导出符合要求的证件照。无论是护照、身份证还是其他类型的证件照片，稿定设计都能帮助您轻松完成，高效便捷地满足各种需求。 </span></div><div class="_observer_igwtw_1 swiper-list-with-grid__observer swiper-list-with-grid__observer--end"></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-list-with-grid__tool swiper-list-with-grid__tool--previous" style="display:none;"><button type="button" aria-label="向左滚动" class="swiper-button-previous-v1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="swiper-button-previous-v1__icon"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M9.49358 12.0312L16.6499 19.1875L15.1226 20.7148L6.43888 12.0312L15.1226 3.34749L16.6499 4.87484L9.49358 12.0312Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></div><div class="swiper-list-with-grid__tool swiper-list-with-grid__tool--next" style="display:none;"><button type="button" aria-label="向右滚动" class="swiper-button-next-v1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="swiper-button-next-v1__icon"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M14.5063 12.0312L7.34998 19.1875L8.87733 20.7148L17.561 12.0312L8.87733 3.34749L7.34998 4.87484L14.5063 12.0312Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div><label><input type="file" hidden="hidden" accept="image/jpg, image/jpeg, image/png" class="file-picker"></label><!----></div></div></section></section></div><script as="state" type="application/json">{"__PRELOADED_STATE__":{}}</script><script>(self.cacheLayer=self.cacheLayer||[]).push({"^header-seo-navs":[],"runtime-context-cache":{"expiresAt":1788236189764,"hasAuthorizationOrSid":false}})</script></web-widget><!--/$--></div><!--$--><web-widget import="https://cdn.dancf.com/apps/gaoding/assets/footer.widget-JwjZdWli.js" name="VLayoutFooter" loading="lazy" rendertarget="light" contextdata="{&quot;useLandingHreflang&quot;:false}" recovering=""><footer data-server-rendered="true" class="Ld9wS"><div><div class="PaeWJ"><div class="v-G2N"><a href="/"><img src="/footer-logo.svg" alt="footer logo" loading="lazy" class="EDXfQ"></a><div class="gGT4o"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-tracker-module="页底导航" class="gd-nav-menu_popup_trigger"><img src="https://gaoding